WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.916 --> 00:00:04.939
The North Star comes out after dark.

2
00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:14.457
If we drive our car at night, we can see the North Star.

3
00:00:15.856 --> 00:00:23.244
If we sit on our porch at night, we can see the North Star.

4
00:00:24.704 --> 00:00:32.125
If we walk in the park at night, we can see the North Star.

5
00:00:33.388 --> 00:00:41.863
If we visit our turtle after dark, we can see the North

6
00:00:42.896 --> 00:00:51.053
Star. If we sit by the river after dark, we can see the North

7
00:00:52.159 --> 00:01:00.399
Star. If we climb the ladder to the roof, we can see the North

8
00:01:01.332 --> 00:01:06.542
Star. Even our dog can see the North

9
00:01:08.738 --> 00:01:35.817
Star!

